# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The following must not enter this repository (it is public):
#
# doc/
#   Course and internal material: milestone descriptions, the project brief
#   (which contains student IDs), the supervisor's mass email (which contains
#   the CCDB project number), and unpublished research-group briefing PDFs.
#   Shared inside the team through OneDrive only.
#   Revisit this rule only if the repository becomes private or authorisation
#   is granted.
#
# reference-scripts/
#   Reference scripts supplied by the PhD student (research group), not
#   cleared for publication, so they stay out of the public repository.
#   If they are confirmed publishable, delete the last line below.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
doc/
reference-scripts/
